<section class="ways" id="donate"><div class="wrap">
<h2>Ways to give</h2>
<p class="sub">About $5 covers one mother's kit: iron tablets for her pregnancy, two health guides in her language, and a handwritten card.</p>
<div class="give">
<div class="give-main"><h3>Give online</h3><p>A secure donation page. You can give once or monthly, and 100% of your gift reaches Heartlines International.</p><a class="btn primary" href="{{ site.donateUrl }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Donate online<span class="vh"> (opens in a new tab)</span></a><p class="small">Heartlines International is a 501(c)(3) public charity (EIN 42-4681667). Gifts are tax-deductible to the extent allowed by law.</p></div>
<div class="give-other">
<p><strong>Give by check.</strong> Make checks payable to &ldquo;Heartlines International.&rdquo; <a href="mailto:{{ site.email }}?subject=Giving%20by%20check">Email us</a> for the mailing address.</p>
<p><strong>Ask about a match.</strong> Many employers match gifts to 501(c)(3) charities like ours. Ask your employer, or email us and we&rsquo;ll help. <a href="mailto:{{ site.email }}?subject=Employer%20matching">Ask us</a></p>
</div>
</div>
</div></section>

<section id="volunteer"><div class="wrap">
<h2>Volunteer</h2>
<p class="sub">Write cards, help pack kits, or help with outreach. No experience needed: we train every volunteer, including on writing with cultural sensitivity.</p>
<div class="actions"><a class="btn ghost" href="mailto:{{ site.email }}?subject=Volunteering%20with%20Heartlines">Email us to volunteer</a></div>
</div></section>

<section id="share"><div class="wrap">
<h2>Spread the word</h2>
<p class="sub">Most of our support comes from people telling people. Three easy ways to help:</p>
<div class="cols3">
<div><h3>Share our story</h3><p>Send our About page to a friend or post it to your story.</p><a class="btn ghost" href="about.html">Read our story</a></div>
<div><h3>Follow and share</h3><p>Follow us on Instagram and share a post that means something to you.</p><a class="btn ghost" href="{{ site.instagramUrl }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Instagram<span class="vh"> (opens in a new tab)</span></a></div>
<div><h3>Bring a group</h3><p>Ask your club, team, or youth group to write cards with us.</p><a class="btn ghost" href="mailto:{{ site.email }}?subject=Group%20volunteering">Email us</a></div>
</div>
</div></section>

